{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"Dirichlet卷积"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"Dirichlet 卷积"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>对于数论函数 $f,g\\colon \\mathbb{N}_+ \\to \\mathbb{C}$,\n其 Dirichlet 卷积 $f*g \\colon \\mathbb{N}_+ \\to \\mathbb{C}$ 定义为\n$$\r\n(f*g) (n) = \\sum_{ij=n}f(i)g(j).\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Möbius函数","text":"Möbius 函数"}},{"Plain":" $\\mu$ 与常值函数 $1$ 的 Dirichlet 卷积是 $\\delta$ 函数 (即 Dirichlet 卷积的单位元):\n$$\r\n\\sum_{i|n}\\mu(i)=\\begin{cases}\r\n    1 &amp; n=1\\\\\r\n    0 &amp; n&gt;1\r\n\\end{cases}\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}